@startuml
' UC21 - Xem Course tổ chức
autonumber "<b>0.</b> "
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor white
skinparam LifeLineBackgroundColor white
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor black
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor black
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam MaxMessageSize 200

' AS-IS evidence; paths are relative to the workspace root.
' UC: docs/uml/docs/LearnUP_UseCase.docx, UC21; UC21.1-21.4 define adjacent scopes.
' BR: docs/uml/docs/LearnUP_QuyTacNghiepVu.docx, BR-64/79/287.
' Requested DOCX files exist under docs/uml/docs, not directly under docs.
' Both metadata revisions are 1; no identified business-spec release can be matched to a snapshot.
' docs/source-of-truth is absent. Architecture support: docs/business/requirements-support.md:35.
' UI: frontend/src/pages/organizer/courses.tsx:126/:177 (loadCourses and mount effect).
' Route: frontend/src/router.tsx:216/:247 (ORGANIZER protection, courses child route).
' API: frontend/src/services/course.service.ts:79 (fetchOrganizationCoursesAPI); :1 uses courseAxios.
' Transport: frontend/src/services/axios.customize.ts:47/:61/:64; frontend/src/config/env.ts:13.
' Local development: frontend/.env.development:10 selects http://localhost:8080.
' No local override file was found; process VITE_COURSE_BACKEND_URL is unset.
' Gateway: gateway/api-gateway/src/main/resources/application.yml:2/:40-43.
' Trusted context: gateway/api-gateway/src/main/java/com/learnup/gateway/filter/JwtAuthenticationFilter.java:133.
' Course prefix/version: services/course-service/src/main.ts:40-43 (api, URI v1).
' Controller: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.controller.ts:106 (findOrganizationCourses).
' Service: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.service.ts:376 (findOrganizationCourses).
' Repository: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.repository.ts:239 (findOrganizationCourses).
' Models: services/course-service/prisma/schema.prisma:18/:31 (CourseChain/Course).
' REST adapters: services/course-service/src/infrastructure/clients/tenant/tenant.client.ts:31;
' services/course-service/src/infrastructure/clients/learning/learning.client.ts:30.
' Timeout: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.module.ts:14 (5000 ms, no redirects).
' Direct REST URLs: services/course-service/.env:4/:5 (Tenant localhost:8084, Learning localhost:8085).
' Tenant endpoint: services/tenant-service/src/modules/users/users.controller.ts:57 (findBatch).
' Tenant query: services/tenant-service/src/modules/users/users.service.ts:502 (findBatch).
' Role-value mismatch: same service:183/:321; common/constants/tenant.constants.ts:9-13.
' Tenant prefix/version: services/tenant-service/src/main.ts:34-37; User model: prisma/schema.prisma:35.
' Learning endpoint: services/learning-service/src/modules/enrollments/enrollments.controller.ts:71.
' Learning query: services/learning-service/src/modules/enrollments/enrollments.service.ts:391.
' Learning prefix/version: services/learning-service/src/app.setup.ts:30-33; Enrollment: prisma/schema.prisma:10.
' Each service uses its own Prisma adapter and DATABASE_URL; local .env:2 names its owned database.

actor Organizer
boundary "Organization Courses Page" as Screen
participant ":ApiGateway" as Gateway
participant ":CoursesController" as Controller
participant ":CoursesService" as Service
participant ":CoursesRepository" as Repository
participant ":UsersController" as UsersController
participant ":UsersService" as UsersService
participant ":EnrollmentsController" as EnrollmentsController
participant ":EnrollmentsService" as EnrollmentsService
database "course_db" as CourseDB
database "tenant_db" as TenantDB
database "learning_db" as LearningDB

' Precondition: authenticated Organizer. Diagram follows the verified local development URL.
' Entry is /organizer/courses without search/filter parameters; initial current=1, pageSize=10.
' Other launch/build modes and live network availability remain unverified.
' JWT/internal-key middleware and token refresh are preconditions, not the main UC trace.

activate Organizer
Organizer -> Screen: Open /organizer/courses
activate Screen
Screen -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/courses/organization
activate Gateway
Gateway -> Controller: GET /api/v1/courses/organization\nTrusted user context
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: Load organization Course page
activate Service
Service -> Service: Verify Organizer and organization context
activate Service
deactivate Service

alt Access checked successfully
  ' Scope is Course.organizationId == user.organizationId from trusted context.
  ' No Instructor self-ownership restriction and no default Published-only predicate.
  ' Public/Private and all six statuses are eligible; Locked/Submitted do not prevent reading.
  Service -> Repository: Load Course page and total\nCurrent organization
  activate Repository
  ' Prisma read transaction: findMany and count with the same where; updatedAt descending.
  ' Select chain.instructorId for each Course version, not just a latest-version representative.
  Repository -> CourseDB: Read scoped Courses and count
  activate CourseDB
  CourseDB -->> Repository: Course page and total
  deactivate CourseDB
  Repository -->> Service: Course page and total
  deactivate Repository

  alt Courses found successfully
    ' Outcome-level alternative: expand both successful REST reads in the success operand.
    ' TenantClient/LearningClient are hidden adapters; service calls go directly to controllers.
    ' Promise.all starts both requests concurrently with the same trusted user/organization context.
    alt Course details loaded\nsuccessfully
      par Load Instructor names
        Service -> UsersController: POST /api/v1/users/batch\nDistinct chain Instructor IDs
        activate UsersController
        UsersController -> UsersService: Load Instructor names
        activate UsersService
        UsersService -> UsersService: Verify Organizer and organization context
        activate UsersService
        deactivate UsersService
        ' findBatch: requested IDs, organizationId, role='INSTRUCTOR', deletedAt=null.
        ' There is no active-status restriction in this query and no additional service call.
        UsersService -> TenantDB: Read organization Instructors
        activate TenantDB
        TenantDB -->> UsersService: Matching Instructors or empty list
        deactivate TenantDB
        UsersService -->> UsersController: Matching Instructors or empty list
        deactivate UsersService
        UsersController -->> Service: 201 Created\nInstructor names or empty list
        deactivate UsersController
      and Load learner counts
        Service -> EnrollmentsController: POST /api/v1/enrollments/learner-counts\nPage Course IDs and user context
        activate EnrollmentsController
        EnrollmentsController -> EnrollmentsService: Load learner counts
        activate EnrollmentsService
        EnrollmentsService -> EnrollmentsService: Verify organization access
        activate EnrollmentsService
        deactivate EnrollmentsService
        ' Allows ORGANIZER/INSTRUCTOR; requires organizationId. Prisma is used directly here.
        ' Group Enrollment by requested courseId within organizationId, status='InProgress'.
        EnrollmentsService -> LearningDB: Count InProgress learners by Course\nCurrent organization
        activate LearningDB
        LearningDB -->> EnrollmentsService: Learner counts
        deactivate LearningDB
        EnrollmentsService -->> EnrollmentsController: Learner counts
        deactivate EnrollmentsService
        EnrollmentsController -->> Service: 201 Created\nLearner counts
        deactivate EnrollmentsController
      end
      ' Both POST endpoints are reads; 201 is the NestJS default and does not mean data was created.
      ' Missing successful Tenant result -> 'Unknown Instructor'; missing count -> 0.
      Service -->> Controller: Courses with Instructor names and counts
      deactivate Service
      Controller -->> Gateway: 200 OK\nCourse page and metadata
      deactivate Controller
      Gateway -->> Screen: Organization Courses
      deactivate Gateway
      Screen -->> Organizer: Show type, status, Instructor and learner count
    else Course detail REST failed
      ' Restore the incoming executions; actor/screen bars remain continuous.
      activate Gateway
      activate Controller
      activate Service
      ' Same concurrent REST attempts: either endpoint returns non-2xx or its transport fails/times out.
      ' Each hidden adapter maps caught HTTP/transport/5000 ms timeout errors to 503.
      ' Failed attempts are summarized here: no successful DB work or reply after timeout is assumed.
      ' Promise.all rejects on the first failure; the other request may still complete independently.
      ' There is no retry, cancellation, cached fallback or partially enriched response.
      Service -->> Controller: REST unavailable or timed out (503)
      deactivate Service
      Controller -->> Gateway: 503 Service Unavailable
      deactivate Controller
      Gateway -->> Screen: Load error
      deactivate Gateway
      Screen -->> Organizer: Show load error and Retry
    end
  else Empty page returned\nsuccessfully
    activate Gateway
    activate Controller
    activate Service
    ' courses.length == 0 returns immediately without either enrichment REST request.
    ' AS-IS resets pages=0 and total=0 even if the DB count was positive for an out-of-range page.
    Service -->> Controller: Empty result; total = 0
    deactivate Service
    Controller -->> Gateway: 200 OK\nEmpty result
    deactivate Controller
    Gateway -->> Screen: Empty Course list
    deactivate Gateway
    Screen -->> Organizer: Show "No Courses found"
  end
else Access check failed
  activate Gateway
  activate Controller
  activate Service
  ' Only non-ORGANIZER or missing trusted organization context reaches this business rejection.
  Service -->> Controller: Access denied (403)
  deactivate Service
  Controller -->> Gateway: 403 Forbidden
  deactivate Controller
  Gateway -->> Screen: Access error
  deactivate Gateway
  Screen -->> Organizer: Show load error and Retry
end
deactivate Screen
deactivate Organizer

' BR-64: Draft, Submitted, Published, Rejected, Archived and Disabled are supported display statuses.
' BR-79 is Instructor-specific; applying user.userId ownership scoping to Organizer would be wrong.
' BR-287: displayed Instructor ID comes from the shared CourseChain, not a per-version creator field.
' This UC reads current chain ownership; transfer execution and status transitions are outside scope.
' The route/DTO accepts no caller-selected organizationId; it cannot select another Organization.
' Gateway strips spoofable organization headers and replaces them with verified JWT claims.
' An unexpected organizationId query field is rejected as 400 by whitelist/forbidNonWhitelisted.
' Do not invent a separate cross-organization 403 comparison absent from findOrganizationCourses.
' Tenant and Learning additionally scope their own queries by the propagated organizationId.
' Counts are per Course version and InProgress only, not every enrollment or unique learners per chain.
' Source gap: createInstructor passes UserRoleValue.Instructor ('Instructor') to createAccount,
' which persists that role. findBatch instead filters the case-sensitive value 'INSTRUCTOR'.
' Users created through the current account flow do not match that predicate and produce an empty
' successful batch result; Course enrichment uses 'Unknown Instructor', not an HTTP failure.
' Existing DB rows have not been inspected; legacy uppercase roles are not assumed absent.
' No chain deduplication or latest-version selection is implemented in the list query.
' Pagination is implemented: this view shows the first default page, not all rows in a single response.
' Pagination interactions and UC21.4 search/filter operations are omitted from the business trace.
' A separate mount effect (frontend/src/pages/organizer/courses.tsx:181) calls
' fetchOrganizationCourseInstructorsAPI -> GET /api/v1/courses/organization/instructors (:89 wrapper).
' This populates only the UC21.4 Instructor filter, not the displayed Course Instructor names.
' That preparation is intentionally omitted; its service method is courses.service.ts:511,
' which uses findOrganizationInstructorIds (repository:269) then TenantClient.getInstructors.
' Filter preparation failures do not stop loadCourses; the filter options stay empty.
' UI clears Courses/total on a list failure and stops loading; Retry invokes loadCourses again.
' HttpExceptionFilter uses error instead of top-level message; UI usually shows its generic fallback.
' Routine DTO validation, persistence failures and transport details are not separate error branches.
' No Course mutation, approval review/decision, assignment, ownership transfer, storage or Kafka.
@enduml
